{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>想走出但不想只去亞洲熱門地？中亞烏茲別克可能就係你下一個目的地！在這裡，你可以用超低價錢享受極致奢華。走進布哈拉的19世紀古堡餐廳，欣賞精美吊燈與壁畫。四個人點滿一桌菜，結帳只需約港幣200元，性價比極高，絕對大滿足！\n</p>\n<p>另外，撒馬爾罕的天台景觀餐廳也是必去之選。坐在露天平台，正對著壯觀的皇宮廣場夜景，現場更有樂隊演奏與煙花，氣氛超好！</p>\n<p>留言「PM」，即刻 send 完整烏茲別克行程詳細資料比你！</p>\n<p>達人帶路 ｜ 旅遊唔想做功課？跟住我哋出發就啱！由各路旅遊達人帶你玩轉世界角落，全方位為你搜羅最新最熱門旅遊情報。如果你都想同大家開心Share，就即刻DM我哋啦！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377203295815062_7100353076aeaca03277be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179377203295815062_7100353076aeaca03277be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@goden._.ally)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfTjLDivh30/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e4%b8%ad%e4%ba%9e%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">中亞旅遊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%83%8f%e8%8c%b2%e5%88%a5%e5%85%8b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">烏茲別克</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@goden._.ally資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfTjLDivh30/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.238826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":435,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:00:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:38:49.729144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:40.024257+00:00","content_hash":"b49c95c288e37d069d2b5cda73617559998b26bcbcd54563179056dd1d811314","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}